{"speciesId":770,"names":{"fr":"Trépassable","es":"Palossand","en":"Palossand","ja":"シロデスナ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Il a possédé un humain pour que ce dernier le remodèle en château de sable, décuplant au passage ses pouvoirs de malédiction."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Manipulando a la gente ha conseguido transformarse en todo un castillo de arena, lo que ha aumentado su poder maligno."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"Possessed people controlled by this Pokémon transformed its sand mound into a castle. As it evolved, its power to curse grew ever stronger."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"人を 操り 砂の山を 砂の城まで 進化 させた。 呪いの 力も あがっている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"On trouve de nombreux ossements sous ses tours, restes de pauvres hères capturés. Leur énergie a servi à nourrir ce Pokémon."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Su castillo alberga abundantes huesos de todos aquellos incautos a los que absorbió su vitalidad por completo antes de quedar sepultados."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"Buried beneath the castle are masses of dried-up bones from those whose vitality it has drained."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"城の 下には 精気を 吸われ 干からびた 者たちの 骨が 大量に 埋まっている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Chacun de ses grains de sable a sa volonté propre. Trépassable gobe de petits Pokémon pour absorber leur énergie vitale."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Cada grano de arena de su cuerpo tiene voluntad propia. Engulle a Pokémon pequeños estando aún vivos para robarles la energía vital."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Each of its grains of sand has its own will. Palossand eats small Pokémon and siphons away their vital essence while they’re still alive."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"一粒の 砂にも 意思が ある。 小さな ポケモンを 呑み込み 生きたまま 生気を 奪う。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Ce terrifiant Pokémon déclenche des tempêtes de sable pour immobiliser ses victimes, puis absorbe leur énergie vitale."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Este temible Pokémon crea tormentas de arena que impiden moverse a sus víctimas y después les arrebata su energía vital."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Once it has whipped up a sandstorm to halt its opponents in their tracks, this terrifying Pokémon snatches away their vitality."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"砂嵐を 巻き起こし 相手の 身動きを 封じてから 生気を 奪う 恐ろしい ポケモンだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"On l’appelle aussi le « cauchemar des plages ». Il contrôle le sable pour ensevelir ses proies et aspirer leur âme."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Lo apodan la Pesadilla de las Playas. Hunde a sus presas en la arena para luego absorberles la energía vital."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"Palossand is known as the Beach Nightmare. It pulls its prey down into the sand by controlling the sand itself, and then it sucks out their souls."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"ビーチの 悪夢とも 呼ばれる。 砂を 操って 獲物を 沈め 魂を 吸い取る。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Bien qu’il déteste l’eau, il vit sur les plages. Quand la pluie s’abat sur lui, il est incapable de conserver sa forme de château de sable."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Habita en las playas, aunque odia el agua. Cuando caen fuertes lluvias, no es capaz de preservar su forma de castillo."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"This Pokémon lives on beaches, but it hates water. Palossand can’t maintain its castle-like shape if it gets drenched by a heavy rain."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"ビーチに 棲むが 水が 嫌い。 激しい 雨に 打たれると お城の 形を 保てない。"}],"varieties":[{"id":770,"moves":[{"name":"sand-attack","learns":[[17,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",9],[18,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",9],[20,"level-up",20],[25,"level-up",20]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"hyper-beam","learns":[[25